<title>NETHERLANDS: ATAG Q1 NET PROFIT FALLS SHARPLY.</title>
<headline>ATAG Q1 NET PROFIT FALLS SHARPLY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.63 vs   2.26</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.6  vs   5.6</p>
<p>    Turnover			     267.2  vs 234.1</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     5.7  vs  11.2</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     4.1  vs   3.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial group Atag Holding NV previously said it</p>
<p>could not give a 1997 forecast, given the uncertain market</p>
<p>situation, particularly for its German subsidiaries.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
